{"id":"vol8-04","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-04/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":343.03,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":6.84,"text":"between a man who wants to rent an apartment and an agent at a property rental service.","words":[["between",0.0,0.58],["a",0.58,1.6],["man",1.6,1.8],["who",1.8,2.06],["wants",2.06,2.36],["to",2.36,2.6],["rent",2.6,2.8],["an",2.8,2.96],["apartment",2.96,3.26],["and",3.26,4.36],["an",4.36,4.56],["agent",4.56,4.88],["at",4.88,5.4],["a",5.4,5.54],["property",5.54,5.8],["rental",5.8,6.22],["service.",6.22,6.84]]},{"start":7.54,"end":12.38,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions one to five.","words":[["First,",7.54,8.22],["you",8.72,8.96],["have",8.96,9.16],["some",9.16,9.34],["time",9.34,9.78],["to",9.78,10.26],["look",10.26,10.42],["at",10.42,10.58],["questions",10.58,10.92],["one",10.92,11.5],["to",11.5,11.92],["five.",11.92,12.38]]},{"start":37.74,"end":42.1,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to five.","words":[["Now",37.74,38.06],["listen",38.06,38.42],["carefully",38.42,38.98],["and",38.98,39.72],["answer",39.72,40.1],["questions",40.1,40.52],["one",40.52,41.12],["to",41.12,41.66],["five.",41.66,42.1]]},{"start":45.4,"end":48.62,"text":"Good morning, AA property. Can I help you?","words":[["Good",45.4,45.92],["morning,",45.92,46.34],["AA",46.7,47.0],["property.",47.0,47.34],["Can",47.98,48.1],["I",48.1,48.22],["help",48.22,48.4],["you?",48.4,48.62]]},{"start":48.94,"end":52.42,"text":"Yes, good morning. I'm looking for an apartment to rent.","words":[["Yes,",48.94,49.26],["good",49.48,49.62],["morning.",49.62,49.88],["I'm",50.4,50.68],["looking",50.68,50.9],["for",50.9,51.34],["an",51.34,51.52],["apartment",51.52,51.88],["to",51.88,52.22],["rent.",52.22,52.42]]},{"start":52.86,"end":55.18,"text":"Okay. Is that here in Birmingham?","words":[["Okay.",52.86,53.42],["Is",53.86,54.2],["that",54.2,54.42],["here",54.42,54.74],["in",54.74,54.94],["Birmingham?",54.94,55.18]]},{"start":55.68,"end":56.14,"text":"That's right.","words":[["That's",55.68,55.98],["right.",55.98,56.14]]},{"start":56.14,"end":63.06,"text":"Right. I'll just take some personal details if I may. So, if I can just take your name.","words":[["Right.",56.14,56.9],["I'll",57.42,57.76],["just",57.76,58.02],["take",58.02,58.28],["some",58.28,58.52],["personal",58.52,59.04],["details",59.04,59.6],["if",59.6,59.9],["I",59.9,60.06],["may.",60.06,60.26],["So,",60.86,61.44],["if",61.58,61.76],["I",61.76,61.9],["can",61.9,62.1],["just",62.1,62.3],["take",62.3,62.5],["your",62.5,62.68],["name.",62.68,63.06]]},{"start":63.52,"end":64.2,"text":"Kevin Walker.","words":[["Kevin",63.52,63.74],["Walker.",63.74,64.2]]},{"start":64.96,"end":68.86,"text":"Right. And can I have your present address please?","words":[["Right.",64.96,65.38],["And",66.02,66.48],["can",66.48,66.88],["I",66.88,67.1],["have",67.1,67.34],["your",67.34,67.5],["present",67.5,67.94],["address",67.94,68.44],["please?",68.44,68.86]]},{"start":69.5,"end":76.5,"text":"Well, we're staying with friends at present. So the address is 354 Forrest Road.","words":[["Well,",69.5,69.84],["we're",69.98,70.2],["staying",70.2,70.46],["with",70.46,70.66],["friends",70.66,70.96],["at",70.96,71.2],["present.",71.2,71.44],["So",72.0,72.24],["the",72.24,72.44],["address",72.44,72.78],["is",72.78,73.24],["354",73.24,75.04],["Forrest",75.04,76.1],["Road.",76.1,76.5]]},{"start":77.06,"end":79.24,"text":"Is that Forrest with 1R?","words":[["Is",77.06,77.34],["that",77.34,77.6],["Forrest",77.6,78.26],["with",78.26,78.5],["1R?",78.5,79.24]]},{"start":79.62,"end":84.94,"text":"That's right. And that's in West Bromwich. I'm afraid I don't know the postcode.","words":[["That's",79.62,80.04],["right.",80.04,80.18],["And",80.94,81.38],["that's",81.38,81.7],["in",81.7,81.8],["West",81.8,81.98],["Bromwich.",81.98,82.38],["I'm",83.24,83.52],["afraid",83.52,83.78],["I",83.78,83.96],["don't",83.96,84.2],["know",84.2,84.36],["the",84.36,84.46],["postcode.",84.46,84.94]]},{"start":84.94,"end":88.46,"text":"That's OK. And a contact phone number?","words":[["That's",84.94,85.96],["OK.",85.96,86.3],["And",86.84,87.18],["a",87.18,87.32],["contact",87.32,87.66],["phone",87.66,88.06],["number?",88.06,88.46]]},{"start":89.68,"end":95.56,"text":"07-817-983-602","words":[["07",89.68,90.36],["-817",90.36,91.04],["-983",91.04,93.44],["-602",93.44,95.56]]},{"start":95.56,"end":99.48,"text":"Lovely. And if I could just ask your occupation?","words":[["Lovely.",95.56,96.46],["And",97.1,97.48],["if",97.48,97.68],["I",97.68,97.86],["could",97.86,98.06],["just",98.06,98.38],["ask",98.38,98.7],["your",98.7,98.9],["occupation?",98.9,99.48]]},{"start":100.12,"end":106.1,"text":"Certainly. I'm a dentist and my wife's a teacher, but she's at home at present looking after the children.","words":[["Certainly.",100.12,100.52],["I'm",100.92,101.08],["a",101.08,101.16],["dentist",101.16,101.44],["and",101.44,102.22],["my",102.22,102.44],["wife's",102.44,102.82],["a",102.82,102.88],["teacher,",102.88,103.2],["but",103.44,103.98],["she's",103.98,104.28],["at",104.28,104.38],["home",104.38,104.6],["at",104.6,104.76],["present",104.76,105.06],["looking",105.06,105.32],["after",105.32,105.64],["the",105.64,105.78],["children.",105.78,106.1]]},{"start":106.78,"end":109.5,"text":"OK, so I'll just put your occupation.","words":[["OK,",106.78,107.18],["so",107.58,107.92],["I'll",107.92,108.26],["just",108.26,108.48],["put",108.48,108.72],["your",108.72,109.08],["occupation.",109.08,109.5]]},{"start":110.14,"end":115.64,"text":"Right, well now I'll take some details about the kind of property you're looking for.","words":[["Right,",110.14,110.74],["well",111.16,111.52],["now",111.52,111.94],["I'll",111.94,112.24],["take",112.24,112.42],["some",112.42,112.64],["details",112.64,113.08],["about",113.08,113.4],["the",113.4,113.62],["kind",113.62,113.96],["of",113.96,114.16],["property",114.16,114.48],["you're",114.48,114.88],["looking",114.88,115.16],["for.",115.16,115.64]]},{"start":116.18,"end":118.84,"text":"You said you're looking for an apartment, is that right?","words":[["You",116.18,116.34],["said",116.34,116.56],["you're",116.56,116.84],["looking",116.84,117.08],["for",117.08,117.34],["an",117.34,117.44],["apartment,",117.44,117.92],["is",117.98,118.42],["that",118.42,118.58],["right?",118.58,118.84]]},{"start":119.28,"end":119.5,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",119.28,119.5]]},{"start":120.0,"end":123.0,"text":"Okay, so how many bedrooms do you want?","words":[["Okay,",120.0,120.52],["so",121.02,121.34],["how",121.34,121.68],["many",121.68,121.88],["bedrooms",121.88,122.36],["do",122.36,122.68],["you",122.68,122.76],["want?",122.76,123.0]]},{"start":123.54,"end":123.78,"text":"Two.","words":[["Two.",123.54,123.78]]},{"start":124.26,"end":125.82,"text":"And did you want it furnished?","words":[["And",124.26,124.58],["did",124.58,124.78],["you",124.78,124.96],["want",124.96,125.18],["it",125.18,125.32],["furnished?",125.32,125.82]]},{"start":126.1,"end":127.3,"text":"No, unfurnished.","words":[["No,",126.1,126.48],["unfurnished.",126.8,127.3]]},{"start":127.84,"end":131.84,"text":"Right, well that gives you quite a bit more choice, so that's good.","words":[["Right,",127.84,128.14],["well",128.62,128.84],["that",128.84,129.14],["gives",129.14,129.4],["you",129.4,129.62],["quite",129.62,129.9],["a",129.9,130.12],["bit",130.12,130.26],["more",130.26,130.48],["choice,",130.48,130.98],["so",131.04,131.28],["that's",131.28,131.58],["good.",131.58,131.84]]},{"start":132.32,"end":135.48,"text":"And what's the maximum rent you'd be prepared to pay?","words":[["And",132.32,132.68],["what's",132.68,133.3],["the",133.3,133.42],["maximum",133.42,133.9],["rent",133.9,134.3],["you'd",134.3,134.64],["be",134.64,134.76],["prepared",134.76,135.04],["to",135.04,135.3],["pay?",135.3,135.48]]},{"start":136.08,"end":145.06,"text":"Well, we'd like to stay under £600 if possible, but we could go up to £650 for the right place.","words":[["Well,",136.08,136.64],["we'd",136.96,137.46],["like",137.46,137.6],["to",137.6,137.9],["stay",137.9,138.34],["under",138.34,138.76],["£600",138.76,139.46],["if",139.46,140.16],["possible,",140.16,140.72],["but",140.72,141.7],["we",141.7,142.02],["could",142.02,142.38],["go",142.38,142.64],["up",142.64,142.82],["to",142.82,142.98],["£650",142.98,144.2],["for",144.2,144.42],["the",144.42,144.5],["right",144.5,144.7],["place.",144.7,145.06]]},{"start":145.92,"end":149.02,"text":"Right, so do you have any other definite requirements?","words":[["Right,",145.92,146.2],["so",146.48,146.78],["do",146.78,147.16],["you",147.16,147.34],["have",147.34,147.54],["any",147.54,147.76],["other",147.76,148.0],["definite",148.0,148.46],["requirements?",148.46,149.02]]},{"start":149.82,"end":153.64,"text":"Well, coming back to the bedrooms, they have to be doubles, both of them.","words":[["Well,",149.82,150.06],["coming",150.2,150.42],["back",150.42,150.66],["to",150.66,150.78],["the",150.78,150.88],["bedrooms,",150.88,151.26],["they",151.68,151.8],["have",151.8,152.02],["to",152.02,152.14],["be",152.14,152.26],["doubles,",152.26,152.62],["both",153.0,153.28],["of",153.28,153.44],["them.",153.44,153.64]]},{"start":154.44,"end":156.62,"text":"Okay, I'll make a note of that.","words":[["Okay,",154.44,155.0],["I'll",155.42,155.7],["make",155.7,155.9],["a",155.9,156.06],["note",156.06,156.24],["of",156.24,156.44],["that.",156.44,156.62]]},{"start":160.08,"end":167.32,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 6 to 10.","words":[["Before",160.08,160.58],["you",160.58,160.9],["hear",160.9,161.16],["the",161.16,161.32],["rest",161.32,161.56],["of",161.56,161.72],["the",161.72,161.82],["conversation,",161.82,162.5],["you",163.22,163.56],["have",163.56,163.8],["some",163.8,164.02],["time",164.02,164.46],["to",164.46,164.9],["look",164.9,165.08],["at",165.08,165.26],["questions",165.26,165.68],["6",165.68,166.42],["to",166.42,166.92],["10.",166.92,167.32]]},{"start":167.32,"end":196.74,"text":"Now listen and answer questions six to ten.","words":[["Now",167.32,168.28],["listen",192.92,193.34],["and",193.34,194.18],["answer",194.18,194.62],["questions",194.62,195.08],["six",195.08,195.8],["to",195.8,196.34],["ten.",196.34,196.74]]},{"start":200.1,"end":202.54,"text":"So are you looking for something straight away?","words":[["So",200.1,200.54],["are",200.54,200.84],["you",200.84,200.98],["looking",200.98,201.2],["for",201.2,201.46],["something",201.46,201.78],["straight",201.78,202.14],["away?",202.14,202.54]]},{"start":203.12,"end":205.42,"text":"I assume you are if you're staying with friends.","words":[["I",203.12,203.36],["assume",203.36,203.7],["you",203.7,204.24],["are",204.24,204.42],["if",204.42,204.6],["you're",204.6,204.74],["staying",204.74,204.98],["with",204.98,205.16],["friends.",205.16,205.42]]},{"start":206.06,"end":207.68,"text":"Well, as soon as possible, yes.","words":[["Well,",206.06,206.42],["as",206.48,206.62],["soon",206.62,206.88],["as",206.88,206.96],["possible,",206.96,207.3],["yes.",207.3,207.68]]},{"start":208.46,"end":210.84,"text":"Well, it's October the 17th today,","words":[["Well,",208.46,208.78],["it's",208.9,209.14],["October",209.14,209.52],["the",209.52,209.72],["17th",209.72,210.42],["today,",210.42,210.84]]},{"start":211.1,"end":214.64,"text":"so we're probably looking at November the 1st at the earliest.","words":[["so",211.1,211.46],["we're",211.46,211.7],["probably",211.7,212.04],["looking",212.04,212.36],["at",212.36,212.62],["November",212.62,213.02],["the",213.02,213.36],["1st",213.36,213.96],["at",213.96,214.06],["the",214.06,214.18],["earliest.",214.18,214.64]]},{"start":215.14,"end":215.82,"text":"Would that be okay?","words":[["Would",215.14,215.28],["that",215.28,215.44],["be",215.44,215.58],["okay?",215.58,215.82]]},{"start":216.42,"end":218.92,"text":"Well, I'd have preferred something in October,","words":[["Well,",216.42,217.04],["I'd",217.12,217.36],["have",217.36,217.46],["preferred",217.46,217.92],["something",217.92,218.3],["in",218.3,218.52],["October,",218.52,218.92]]},{"start":218.96,"end":222.02,"text":"but okay, let's put that date down for now.","words":[["but",218.96,219.48],["okay,",219.48,220.26],["let's",220.48,220.8],["put",220.8,220.98],["that",220.98,221.28],["date",221.28,221.5],["down",221.5,221.7],["for",221.7,221.84],["now.",221.84,222.02]]},{"start":222.02,"end":228.82,"text":"fine now is there anything else you'd like well our last flat had a garage but","words":[["fine",222.02,222.92],["now",222.92,223.82],["is",223.82,224.04],["there",224.04,224.22],["anything",224.22,224.6],["else",224.6,225.0],["you'd",225.0,225.36],["like",225.36,225.6],["well",225.6,226.58],["our",226.58,226.84],["last",226.84,227.22],["flat",227.22,227.46],["had",227.46,227.74],["a",227.74,227.86],["garage",227.86,228.16],["but",228.16,228.82]]},{"start":228.82,"end":233.7,"text":"actually we never used it so I'm not really worried about that but we'd like","words":[["actually",228.82,229.36],["we",229.36,229.72],["never",229.72,229.96],["used",229.96,230.28],["it",230.28,230.5],["so",230.5,230.84],["I'm",230.84,231.34],["not",231.34,231.48],["really",231.48,231.7],["worried",231.7,232.02],["about",232.02,232.22],["that",232.22,232.48],["but",232.48,233.3],["we'd",233.3,233.56],["like",233.56,233.7]]},{"start":233.7,"end":239.7,"text":"a balcony if possible it's nice not to be too shut in yes you'll find most modern","words":[["a",233.7,233.84],["balcony",233.84,234.22],["if",234.22,234.48],["possible",234.48,234.82],["it's",234.82,235.4],["nice",235.4,235.6],["not",235.6,235.94],["to",235.94,236.12],["be",236.12,236.26],["too",236.26,236.54],["shut",236.54,236.8],["in",236.8,237.04],["yes",237.04,237.84],["you'll",237.84,238.66],["find",238.66,238.92],["most",238.92,239.38],["modern",239.38,239.7]]},{"start":239.7,"end":244.52,"text":"apartments do have one it's only the converted properties that don't but of","words":[[